WEBVTT

01:35.710 --> 01:40.759
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.680 --> 01:44.009
[Episode 3]

01:47.120 --> 01:49.050
What do you think, Prime Minister?

01:50.350 --> 01:52.120
Shouldn't I kill him?

02:08.910 --> 02:09.710
Your Majesty.

02:09.910 --> 02:12.590
He deserves to be executed for
attempted assassination of the First Prince.

02:12.590 --> 02:14.630
I also believe that

02:15.000 --> 02:16.910
the First Prince won’t make things up.

02:16.910 --> 02:18.510
Since he has pleaded guilty,

02:18.630 --> 02:19.079
I think

02:20.190 --> 02:21.360
he must be involved.

02:23.960 --> 02:25.820
You're making it sound so simple.

02:26.310 --> 02:29.190
He is your adopted son.

02:30.800 --> 02:32.280
He is just an outer disciple

02:32.280 --> 02:33.750
of the Zhuang family.

02:34.630 --> 02:36.360
I only took him as my adopted son

02:36.400 --> 02:38.530
so that I wouldn't die alone in old age.

02:42.000 --> 02:42.680
Alas,

02:43.800 --> 02:45.600
an adopted son is still adopted.

02:45.630 --> 02:47.490
If he really took me as his father,

02:47.710 --> 02:49.680
he wouldn't have done such

02:50.520 --> 02:52.320
treasonous acts behind my back!

02:52.750 --> 02:53.550
Your Majesty,

02:54.310 --> 02:55.910
I failed to teach my son well.

02:55.960 --> 02:57.910
I deserve to die!

03:01.470 --> 03:03.630
Since you said so,

03:04.280 --> 03:05.190
it seems that

03:05.280 --> 03:06.810
I did not kill the innocent.

03:07.280 --> 03:08.360
It seems like Her Majesty

03:08.360 --> 03:09.520
has foresight.

03:09.960 --> 03:11.760
The fifth day of May is a good day.

03:12.030 --> 03:14.590
Second Brother has reached adulthood,
a cause to celebrate,

03:14.590 --> 03:15.680
while I have also caught

03:15.680 --> 03:17.540
a spy from the Battle of Pingling,

03:20.470 --> 03:21.960
and can finally

03:22.000 --> 03:23.329
answer to Your Majesty.

03:34.710 --> 03:36.680
The Second Prince is here.

03:46.240 --> 03:47.800
I have just finished
my coming-of-age ceremony,

03:47.800 --> 03:49.000
and as per etiquette,

03:49.910 --> 03:51.700
I'm here to pay my respects to you,
Mother.

03:51.700 --> 03:53.460
[Empress of Susha Kingdom, Zhuang Jingyuan]

04:05.430 --> 04:06.240
Get up.

04:08.010 --> 04:10.000
The coming-of-age ceremony
is already over?

04:10.000 --> 04:10.960
Brother is back.

04:11.710 --> 04:14.310
He said that he had something important
to discuss with Father,

04:14.310 --> 04:15.520
so I came back early.

04:16.390 --> 04:17.829
Nothing should be important enough

04:17.829 --> 04:19.920
to disturb your coming-of-age ceremony.

04:19.920 --> 04:21.070
Brother has said that

04:21.070 --> 04:22.000
he will

04:22.000 --> 04:23.600
make it up to me in the future.

04:24.630 --> 04:25.430
You may leave.

04:25.870 --> 04:26.480
Yes.

04:29.190 --> 04:29.600
Come.

04:33.960 --> 04:35.480
Today is your coming-of-age ceremony.

04:35.480 --> 04:37.750
I prepared a gift for you.

04:39.560 --> 04:40.700
This book

04:40.740 --> 04:43.060
[Qian Ruoshui]

04:40.830 --> 04:41.600
records all the details of

04:41.600 --> 04:43.480
all the civil and military ministers.

04:43.480 --> 04:45.520
Those whom your Father deeply trusts,

04:43.670 --> 04:44.370
[Zhao Shidao]

04:45.920 --> 04:48.240
those whom are in relations
with the Zhuang,

04:48.240 --> 04:50.870
and those whom you need
to build relations with.

04:50.870 --> 04:51.600
I have ordered people

04:51.600 --> 04:52.850
to record it down with detail.

04:52.850 --> 04:54.750
Now, you're all grown up.

04:55.120 --> 04:56.480
You must do your best

04:56.680 --> 04:58.270
to help your Father.

04:59.000 --> 05:00.480
Help Father?

05:00.890 --> 05:02.430
Brother is enough for that.

05:03.270 --> 05:04.060
I

05:04.310 --> 05:05.870
just want to practice swordsmanship.

05:05.870 --> 05:07.070
So that in the future,

05:07.070 --> 05:09.290
I can be like Brother

05:09.360 --> 05:10.880
and become a brave hero.

05:11.430 --> 05:12.230
Mother, look.

05:12.750 --> 05:13.240
This is

05:14.240 --> 05:17.270
the coming-of-age ceremony gift
that Brother gave me.

05:17.270 --> 05:18.240
He's got you so satisfied

05:18.240 --> 05:19.270
with just a sword.

05:19.600 --> 05:21.260
How many times have I told you?

05:21.720 --> 05:23.190
Your Brother is a deep thinker.

05:23.190 --> 05:24.950
You two aren't from the same womb.

05:24.950 --> 05:26.750
You mustn't get too close to him.

05:27.390 --> 05:29.320
Brother is not that kind of person.

05:29.830 --> 05:31.040
He is brave, good at fighting,

05:31.040 --> 05:31.560
and

05:31.720 --> 05:33.250
he's an upright man.

05:33.480 --> 05:35.270
He's a great hero in my heart!

05:35.950 --> 05:37.120
I'm telling you this

05:37.120 --> 05:38.630
for your own good.

05:39.360 --> 05:41.560
You and the First Prince are different.

05:42.070 --> 05:43.390
The better he treats you,

05:43.390 --> 05:45.120
the more you should be careful.

05:45.680 --> 05:46.409
Understand?

05:46.920 --> 05:48.240
Yes.

05:49.310 --> 05:50.560
Mother,

05:50.600 --> 05:52.240
if there's nothing else,

05:52.950 --> 05:55.210
I'm going to practice my swordsmanship.

06:01.920 --> 06:04.190
Must you choose the day
of your Brother's coming-of-age ceremony

06:04.190 --> 06:05.360
to spill blood?

06:05.950 --> 06:08.110
What are you up to?

06:08.630 --> 06:09.750
Setting the coming-of-age ceremony

06:09.750 --> 06:11.360
on the fifth day of May.

06:12.190 --> 06:13.480
What is Her Majesty

06:13.510 --> 06:14.240
up to?

06:14.240 --> 06:14.970
How dare you!

06:16.230 --> 06:17.240
I have never

06:17.270 --> 06:19.120
asked you to be biased towards me.

06:19.120 --> 06:21.350
But everything should be reasonable.

06:21.800 --> 06:23.240
The treacherous minister
wants to harm me,

06:23.240 --> 06:24.770
but yet you are not enraged.

06:25.160 --> 06:26.430
I as a prince
killed a treacherous minister,

06:26.430 --> 06:28.030
but Father wants to blame me.

06:28.430 --> 06:30.920
Are you still making excuses
in front of me?

06:31.680 --> 06:33.409
Since Father wants to blame me,

06:33.600 --> 06:34.720
how about this?

06:42.120 --> 06:43.390
You should just

06:43.390 --> 06:45.870
stab me in the chest with an arrow

06:46.430 --> 06:46.920
right now to give my life

06:46.920 --> 06:48.600
for the one that I took.

06:52.390 --> 06:53.360
How about it?

06:55.390 --> 06:56.120
Enough.

06:57.000 --> 06:58.800
How inappropriate you are!

06:59.240 --> 07:00.160
You've been

07:00.190 --> 07:01.720
used to wandering outside.

07:01.720 --> 07:04.190
You don't even know how
to behave in front of me now.

07:04.190 --> 07:05.240
I've been like this

07:05.240 --> 07:06.510
since I was a child.

07:11.040 --> 07:12.690
Since you're injured,

07:13.480 --> 07:14.880
I'll let it slide for now.

07:15.480 --> 07:16.740
Can I leave now?

07:16.800 --> 07:18.330
There's a banquet tonight.

07:18.510 --> 07:19.720
You can show up

07:20.000 --> 07:21.160
before you go back to rest.

07:21.160 --> 07:22.220
Maybe another day.

07:22.270 --> 07:24.160
Your brother has been talking about

07:24.160 --> 07:25.890
how he wants to be closer to you.

07:26.000 --> 07:27.190
If you don't show up,

07:27.830 --> 07:29.480
he will be disappointed.

07:29.870 --> 07:31.730
I'll make it up to him another day.

07:31.950 --> 07:33.310
But not today.

07:33.720 --> 07:35.750
I have to go back to see my Mother.

07:39.510 --> 07:41.640
A Mother's sacrifice is hard to repay.

07:42.040 --> 07:44.190
I beg Your Majesty's permission.

08:05.030 --> 08:07.190
[Wutong Mansion]

08:10.720 --> 08:12.920
You earned great merit
in the Battle of Pingling,

08:12.920 --> 08:14.180
yet as a hero of Jinxiu,

08:14.190 --> 08:15.790
you’ve fallen to such a fate.

08:16.070 --> 08:17.830
What happened to you wasn't an accident.

08:17.830 --> 08:19.870
Someone in Jinxiu wants you dead.

08:19.950 --> 08:22.060
Who is it, and why?

08:29.610 --> 08:30.920
You've lost your memory
and are seriously injured.

08:30.920 --> 08:32.630
You're no better than
a cripple now.

08:32.630 --> 08:33.429
If you resist,

08:33.480 --> 08:34.960
you'll only hurt yourself.

08:34.960 --> 08:36.890
I didn't spare you
out of kindness.

08:36.960 --> 08:39.179
I just want you to surrender willingly.

08:39.630 --> 08:40.600
Don't you want to know

08:40.600 --> 08:42.090
who shot you on the cliff?

08:42.120 --> 08:43.250
Who wanted you dead?

08:54.000 --> 08:54.790
He's right.

08:55.490 --> 08:57.420
There's no point in resisting now.

08:57.510 --> 08:59.640
Only by living can I find out the truth.

09:00.390 --> 09:01.080
Maybe

09:01.610 --> 09:02.700
I can use him.

09:03.360 --> 09:04.770
But what does he want?

09:05.390 --> 09:07.010
Who wanted me dead,

09:07.290 --> 09:08.470
and why?

09:18.070 --> 09:20.240
[Memorial tablet of the Benevolent, Virtuous,
and Compassionate Empress Yu Qingyu]

09:20.370 --> 09:23.350
[Eternal Radiance of Virtue]

09:44.370 --> 09:47.820
[Memorial tablet of the Benevolent, Virtuous,
and Compassionate Empress Yu Qingyu]

09:49.770 --> 09:51.180
[Changchun Palace]

09:51.630 --> 09:52.200
Mother!

09:54.790 --> 09:55.650
Your Highness.

09:56.150 --> 09:56.790
Step aside!

09:56.790 --> 09:57.840
I want to see my Mother!

09:57.240 --> 09:58.990
[Changchun Palace]

09:58.540 --> 09:59.340
Your Majesty.

09:59.670 --> 10:00.320
The Jinxiu spy we caught

10:00.320 --> 10:01.590
has confessed that

10:00.370 --> 10:02.530
[Changchun Palace]

10:01.630 --> 10:03.160
you're also an accomplice.

10:03.550 --> 10:04.630
Your personal maid

10:04.790 --> 10:05.550
has also testified that

10:05.550 --> 10:07.320
you've met Jinxiu men in secret.

10:07.320 --> 10:08.550
Who do you think you are?

10:08.120 --> 10:11.230
[Changchun Palace]

10:09.080 --> 10:10.810
I’m talking to Feng Pingcheng.

10:10.840 --> 10:12.300
You have no place to speak!

10:12.870 --> 10:14.070
Protect His Majesty!

10:21.600 --> 10:23.220
[Grace in Blessed Accord]

10:23.280 --> 10:24.810
[Changchun Palace]

10:34.320 --> 10:35.000
Father.

10:35.600 --> 10:37.390
Father, where is my Mother?

10:40.320 --> 10:40.960
Father.

10:42.200 --> 10:43.260
Where is my Mother?

10:58.360 --> 10:59.320
Mother!

11:00.760 --> 11:01.900
Let go of me!

11:02.080 --> 11:03.150
Mother!

11:08.870 --> 11:10.030
Let go of me!

11:10.200 --> 11:11.670
Mother!

11:14.300 --> 11:16.370
[Eternal Radiance of Virtue]

11:21.120 --> 11:21.840
Father.

11:22.000 --> 11:23.160
Where is Mother?

11:23.630 --> 11:24.490
Your Mother...

11:26.400 --> 11:27.620
Mother!

11:27.870 --> 11:29.130
Your Mother is asleep.

11:30.000 --> 11:31.030
Mother!

11:32.000 --> 11:33.670
Mother!

11:35.150 --> 11:36.630
Mother!

11:40.200 --> 11:41.000
Consort Yuan.

11:42.120 --> 11:44.030
Xiyang and Suige

11:44.960 --> 11:46.760
will be under your care.

11:48.320 --> 11:49.440
Yes, Your Majesty.

11:59.910 --> 12:01.780
Xiyang and I only have one Mother.

12:01.830 --> 12:03.360
I don't want her to raise me.

12:04.520 --> 12:06.150
From now on,

12:07.200 --> 12:07.790
she

12:11.960 --> 12:14.240
is your Mother.

12:18.750 --> 12:21.990
[Memorial tablet of the Benevolent, Virtuous,
and Compassionate Empress Yu Qingyu]

12:29.300 --> 12:31.620
[Memorial tablet of the Benevolent, Virtuous,
and Compassionate Empress Yu Qingyu]

12:32.400 --> 12:33.260
Your Highness.

12:33.700 --> 12:34.200
Your Highness,

12:34.200 --> 12:35.800
you predicted it correctly.

12:35.910 --> 12:37.320
As expected, the people at Jinxiu

12:37.320 --> 12:39.070
are searching for Fu Yixiao.

12:39.510 --> 12:40.600
Our spy reported that

12:40.600 --> 12:42.420
Jinxiu has spread news that

12:43.150 --> 12:44.600
Commander Fu fell off the cliff,

12:44.600 --> 12:45.170
her survival still a question.

12:45.170 --> 12:46.360
Prince of Zhennan Xia Jingshi

12:46.360 --> 12:47.910
gave three orders within a few weeks,

12:47.910 --> 12:49.710
He won't stop until he finds her.

12:51.960 --> 12:53.560
What's wrong, Your Highness?

12:53.560 --> 12:54.320
Don't tell anyone

12:54.320 --> 12:55.550
about her identity.

12:55.570 --> 12:57.150
Yes, I've made sure of it.

12:57.600 --> 12:58.600
But are you really going to

12:58.600 --> 12:59.340
keep her by your side?

12:59.340 --> 13:00.390
She's an enemy Commander.

13:00.390 --> 13:02.250
We're raising a threat next to us.

13:02.840 --> 13:04.080
When I think of the comrades

13:04.080 --> 13:05.240
that sacrificed in Pingling,

13:05.240 --> 13:06.970
I just want to stab her to death.

13:08.390 --> 13:09.240
From now on,

13:09.690 --> 13:11.090
she is no longer an enemy.

13:11.550 --> 13:13.150
Not only can you not hurt her,

13:13.200 --> 13:15.400
but you also have to treat her politely.

13:16.910 --> 13:17.550
I know that

13:18.000 --> 13:19.200
it's hard

13:19.240 --> 13:20.420
to turn a foe into a friend,

13:20.420 --> 13:21.950
but you have to overcome it.

13:22.630 --> 13:24.030
This is a military order.

13:26.910 --> 13:28.510
Your Highness, you said that

13:28.600 --> 13:29.960
the Battle in Pingling

13:30.000 --> 13:31.270
isn't as simple as we thought.

13:31.270 --> 13:32.270
We need Fu Yixiao

13:32.320 --> 13:33.240
to solve the mystery for us.

13:33.240 --> 13:33.840
But when will we be

13:33.840 --> 13:35.510
able to solve this mystery?

13:36.360 --> 13:38.030
We will know when she

13:38.840 --> 13:40.040
agrees to cooperate.

13:44.360 --> 13:47.950
[Memorial tablet of late son Zhuang He]

13:50.790 --> 13:51.550
Uncle,

13:52.670 --> 13:55.120
Feng Suige brutally beheaded

13:55.910 --> 13:57.390
Brother He on the streets

13:57.440 --> 13:59.040
without a shred of evidence.

13:59.750 --> 14:01.270
You didn't even attempt

14:02.550 --> 14:04.750
to clear his name in court

14:06.480 --> 14:09.480
and let him die in vain.

14:09.520 --> 14:11.980
[Memorial tablet of late son Zhuang He]

14:26.520 --> 14:27.410
Uncle,

14:28.240 --> 14:29.030
can we really

14:29.080 --> 14:30.000
do nothing

14:30.030 --> 14:32.010
about Feng Suige?

14:38.320 --> 14:39.780
Brother He died unjustly.

14:40.550 --> 14:41.630
It's all my fault.

14:42.750 --> 14:44.720
If I had stopped him that day,

14:45.270 --> 14:47.200
and didn't let him send assassins,

14:48.060 --> 14:50.450
this wouldn't have happened.

14:50.600 --> 14:51.720
The assassination

14:51.750 --> 14:53.000
was done by him alone.

14:54.000 --> 14:55.250
When you found out,

14:56.120 --> 14:58.580
the assassins he arranged had already left.

14:59.110 --> 15:00.770
Even if you wanted to stop him,

15:01.120 --> 15:02.160
it was too late.

15:03.550 --> 15:04.350
Could it be...

15:04.960 --> 15:06.200
You knew about

15:06.200 --> 15:07.860
Brother He's plans all along?

15:10.480 --> 15:15.000
[Memorial tablet of late son Zhuang He]

15:11.150 --> 15:13.080
He has been with me for so many years.

15:13.080 --> 15:14.750
I know his every move.

15:15.390 --> 15:17.270
I just didn't expect Feng Suige

15:18.080 --> 15:19.150
would be so lawless.

15:19.090 --> 15:21.580
[Memorial tablet of late son Zhuang He]

15:20.240 --> 15:21.510
This blood debt

15:22.440 --> 15:24.000
will be repaid.

15:26.680 --> 15:28.970
I'm willing to do my best

15:29.360 --> 15:31.940
to serve you.

15:32.600 --> 15:34.600
Don't just think that getting rid of

15:34.630 --> 15:36.560
Feng Suige is all about the throne.

15:36.670 --> 15:37.840
I'm the Prime Minister now.

15:37.840 --> 15:39.270
I'm already in power.

15:39.480 --> 15:40.750
To me, the power struggle

15:40.750 --> 15:41.790
for the throne is not so important.

15:41.790 --> 15:43.150
All I do is just

15:43.870 --> 15:45.550
to show someone that

15:46.390 --> 15:47.960
fate never misses.

15:49.630 --> 15:51.310
What goes around, comes around.

15:51.310 --> 15:53.830
[Memorial tablet of late son Zhuang He]

16:00.250 --> 16:02.280
[Susha Kingdom, the streets of Yujing City]

16:03.600 --> 16:04.120
Yes.

16:04.960 --> 16:06.320
Have a look!

16:08.030 --> 16:12.870
Bravo! Bravo!

16:14.440 --> 16:14.910
Bravo!

16:17.080 --> 16:18.030
Bravo!

16:19.030 --> 16:19.550
Bravo!

16:28.430 --> 16:33.970
[Princess of Susha Kingdom, Feng Xiyang]

16:37.150 --> 16:38.030
Brother!

16:38.600 --> 16:39.440
You scared me!

16:42.070 --> 16:42.550
Take it.

16:47.070 --> 16:52.150
[Rice cake]

16:48.570 --> 16:50.310
I heard that you got hurt.

16:50.870 --> 16:52.010
Where are you hurt?

16:52.510 --> 16:53.570
Are you hurt badly?

16:54.000 --> 16:55.240
I lost the battle.

16:55.260 --> 16:56.600
If I didn't say that I was injured,

16:56.600 --> 16:58.460
I'd get punished when I come back.

16:58.780 --> 17:00.060
You're lying again.

17:00.030 --> 17:01.570
[Rice cake]

17:02.390 --> 17:03.630
Try it. Is it good?

17:04.890 --> 17:06.270
Let's find a place

17:06.400 --> 17:08.069
to have some tea and have a chat.

17:08.069 --> 17:08.599
Let's go.

17:09.589 --> 17:11.109
Bravo! Bravo!

17:13.400 --> 17:15.200
Bravo! Bravo!

17:15.240 --> 17:16.200
Wonderful! Wonderful!

17:16.200 --> 17:17.079
Wonderful!

17:17.319 --> 17:18.540
This way, please.

17:18.640 --> 17:19.230
Okay.

17:19.880 --> 17:21.640
Bravo!

17:23.240 --> 17:25.589
Bravo!

17:26.589 --> 17:27.160
Bravo!

17:28.109 --> 17:28.750
Yeah.

17:28.920 --> 17:29.830
Wonderful!

17:30.590 --> 17:32.200
Bravo!

17:38.110 --> 17:40.590
Bravo! Bravo!

17:40.960 --> 17:41.880
Bravo!

17:57.920 --> 17:58.720
You watch out.

17:58.750 --> 18:00.000
If you don't eat dinner,

18:00.000 --> 18:01.800
Her Majesty will be suspicious.

18:02.360 --> 18:05.120
I'll just tell her that
my stomach isn't feeling well.

18:05.120 --> 18:06.850
I've even prepared what to say.

18:09.550 --> 18:10.370
I can't do anything

18:10.370 --> 18:11.650
in the palace.

18:11.790 --> 18:13.480
If I walk too fast, Nanny will say,

18:13.480 --> 18:15.410
"Princess, you should be steady."

18:15.550 --> 18:17.270
If I eat too fast, Nanny will say,

18:17.270 --> 18:18.960
"Princess, you should be graceful."

18:18.960 --> 18:20.820
Even for my sleep, Nanny will say,

18:20.830 --> 18:22.720
"Princess, you're of royal descent."

18:22.720 --> 18:24.580
"You can't breathe too heavily."

18:24.960 --> 18:26.350
I'm asleep.

18:26.400 --> 18:27.310
How do I know

18:27.350 --> 18:28.750
if my breathing is heavy?

18:29.680 --> 18:31.330
Breathing heavy?

18:31.720 --> 18:33.170
That means you snore.

18:33.270 --> 18:34.460
Watch out.

18:34.550 --> 18:36.440
What if your future consort

18:36.480 --> 18:38.440
doesn't like you snoring in your sleep?

18:38.440 --> 18:38.840
You...

18:43.720 --> 18:44.270
Alright.

18:45.160 --> 18:46.150
If your future consort

18:46.150 --> 18:47.210
dares to bully you,

18:47.270 --> 18:48.230
Tell me.

18:48.590 --> 18:49.790
I'll stand up for you.

18:57.590 --> 18:58.990
Has someone wronged you?

19:03.270 --> 19:04.750
Tell me who bullied you.

19:05.200 --> 19:06.600
I'll make them regret it.

19:06.960 --> 19:08.000
Brother,

19:08.240 --> 19:10.370
even you have been wronged by someone.

19:11.680 --> 19:13.110
No one in the royal family

19:13.830 --> 19:15.680
hasn't been wronged.

19:16.530 --> 19:18.420
I really miss my childhood

19:19.240 --> 19:20.900
when I was carefree every day.

19:21.790 --> 19:22.590
I always felt like

19:22.590 --> 19:24.440
I was the happiest

19:24.510 --> 19:26.160
and luckiest person in the world.

19:26.160 --> 19:28.360
But the more I grow up, the more I realize

19:28.720 --> 19:29.750
everything that I received

19:29.750 --> 19:31.160
has a price to be paid.

19:32.350 --> 19:33.400
As a princess,

19:34.110 --> 19:35.510
other than my life,

19:35.880 --> 19:37.750
everything else
belongs to the royal family,

19:37.750 --> 19:38.640
to Susha.

19:39.830 --> 19:40.510
All of them

19:40.550 --> 19:42.350
are very respectful towards me,

19:42.440 --> 19:43.180
but no one

19:43.210 --> 19:45.340
really cares about what I'm thinking.

19:45.790 --> 19:46.510
I know.

19:47.590 --> 19:49.120
This is my responsibility.

19:49.510 --> 19:51.240
Being born in the royal family,

19:51.440 --> 19:52.400
everyone has

19:52.440 --> 19:53.970
their own responsibility.

19:54.240 --> 19:56.370
But I just want to live for myself once.

19:58.000 --> 19:59.400
Even if it's just once.

20:07.550 --> 20:08.350
Brother,

20:09.510 --> 20:12.240
you're the only one
I can have this conversation with.

20:12.240 --> 20:14.300
You won't find me bothersome, do you?

20:14.350 --> 20:15.240
Silly girl.

20:16.030 --> 20:17.030
I'm your Brother.

20:17.680 --> 20:19.680
Even if I do I'd still have to listen.

20:20.880 --> 20:22.720
Since you are my Brother.

20:24.720 --> 20:25.590
You have to endure my hits.

20:25.590 --> 20:26.250
No dodging!

20:26.350 --> 20:27.120
No dodging!

20:27.240 --> 20:27.960
It hurts.

20:29.270 --> 20:30.070
Are you okay?

20:39.480 --> 20:40.400
All right.

20:42.590 --> 20:43.390
You're right.

20:44.030 --> 20:46.270
No one in the royal family
hasn't been wronged.

20:46.270 --> 20:48.070
But I fought hard during battles

20:48.270 --> 20:49.750
and made great achievements

20:49.750 --> 20:50.330
just to make sure

20:50.330 --> 20:51.420
you don't suffer.

20:52.680 --> 20:53.410
Don't worry.

20:54.000 --> 20:54.720
I will remember

20:54.720 --> 20:55.880
what you said.

21:14.350 --> 21:15.750
All right, you may leave.

21:16.030 --> 21:16.590
Yes.

21:22.400 --> 21:24.000
Although He'er is an adopted son,

21:24.000 --> 21:25.240
he is still a Zhuang.

21:25.880 --> 21:27.340
This Feng Suige

21:27.380 --> 21:28.510
is so unbridled that

21:28.830 --> 21:30.290
he dare kill him in public?

21:31.240 --> 21:32.410
At this point,

21:32.570 --> 21:33.720
there's no point in speaking of it.

21:33.720 --> 21:35.180
It's just a pity for He'er.

21:35.920 --> 21:36.680
He did look

21:37.480 --> 21:39.580
somewhat similar do Jingheng.

21:39.830 --> 21:40.960
I didn't expect that

21:41.000 --> 21:43.060
he couldn't live past thirty as well.

21:43.480 --> 21:45.310
It was Chengyang's coming-of-age ceremony

21:45.310 --> 21:47.000
and yet he spilled blood in court.

21:47.000 --> 21:47.860
Looks like

21:48.590 --> 21:50.790
he's targeting the Zhuang family soon.

21:51.000 --> 21:52.680
He's no longer the kid

21:52.750 --> 21:54.880
that only knows how to cry 15 years ago.

21:56.160 --> 21:57.090
You shouldn't have

21:57.090 --> 21:58.550
arranged Chengyang's
coming-of-age ceremony

21:58.550 --> 21:59.680
of the fifth of May

21:59.790 --> 22:01.200
just for a moment of satisfaction.

22:01.200 --> 22:02.990
You should have listened to me

22:03.110 --> 22:04.750
and gotten rid of Feng Suige early on.

22:04.750 --> 22:05.830
Then something like this

22:05.830 --> 22:07.070
wouldn't have happened.

22:07.070 --> 22:07.920
A young prince

22:07.960 --> 22:09.400
can't cause any trouble.

22:10.590 --> 22:12.410
If a young prince

22:12.510 --> 22:13.570
died in the palace,

22:13.680 --> 22:14.680
His Majesty would've

22:14.680 --> 22:15.440
started to suspect

22:15.440 --> 22:16.550
me and you.

22:19.310 --> 22:20.270
Your Highness's swordsmanship

22:20.270 --> 22:21.480
has improved a lot.

22:23.350 --> 22:25.350
Thanks to the sword Brother gave me.

22:27.070 --> 22:28.930
If not for the years of endurance,

22:29.770 --> 22:31.770
there wouldn't be Chengyang today.

22:32.200 --> 22:32.880
So,

22:33.830 --> 22:34.760
we can't rush it.

22:35.060 --> 22:36.660
Feng Suige is the eldest son.

22:37.000 --> 22:38.880
Now he's of the age to get married.

22:39.240 --> 22:40.790
Once he gets married and has children,

22:40.790 --> 22:43.020
it's only a matter of time before he gets his title.

22:43.020 --> 22:44.720
Along with his outstanding military achievements…

22:44.720 --> 22:45.720
So you think that

22:45.750 --> 22:47.150
he's the best candidate?

22:47.350 --> 22:48.680
As long as Feng Suige is alive,

22:48.680 --> 22:50.740
how can Chengyang ascend the throne?

22:51.070 --> 22:52.000
I am willing to obey

22:52.000 --> 22:53.350
whatever you decide, Father.

22:53.350 --> 22:54.150
But right now,

22:54.180 --> 22:55.720
we can't wait any longer.

22:56.450 --> 22:59.080
The Jinxiu marriage
proposal will arrive soon.

22:59.080 --> 23:00.190
Make preparations

23:00.510 --> 23:02.570
for Xiyang to marry into their court.

23:08.420 --> 23:09.020
Father...

23:09.490 --> 23:11.290
Father, what do you mean by this?

23:11.440 --> 23:13.880
What happened before
has nothing to do with you.

23:13.880 --> 23:14.940
Don't ask further.

23:17.790 --> 23:19.240
May Your Majesty enjoy health and peace.

23:19.240 --> 23:20.680
I'll take my leave.

23:46.910 --> 23:47.580
Feng Suige,

23:48.110 --> 23:49.310
you locked me up here.

23:49.590 --> 23:50.990
What exactly do you want?

24:00.590 --> 24:02.420
Looks like you've recovered well.

24:02.420 --> 24:03.820
You've got strength now.

24:03.980 --> 24:04.730
Answer me.

24:05.130 --> 24:06.160
I spared your life

24:06.160 --> 24:06.910
and let you stay here

24:06.910 --> 24:08.200
not so you could recover

24:08.200 --> 24:10.140
and then cry for my blood.

24:10.220 --> 24:10.980
I told you

24:11.330 --> 24:12.860
I don't remember anything.

24:12.960 --> 24:14.670
Don't waste your efforts on me.

24:14.670 --> 24:16.510
If you can't remember, then forget it.

24:16.510 --> 24:17.830
At least you
still have your martial skills.

24:17.830 --> 24:18.960
It would be a pity if you died.

24:18.960 --> 24:20.240
My left hand is crippled.

24:20.240 --> 24:22.030
Still enough
to throw an inkstone at me, isn't it?

24:22.030 --> 24:22.890
That's enough.

24:22.920 --> 24:23.700
I'll find someone

24:23.700 --> 24:24.900
to heal that arm.

24:24.930 --> 24:25.510
No need.

24:26.480 --> 24:27.810
This is no charity hall.

24:28.350 --> 24:29.200
I spared you

24:29.240 --> 24:30.960
because I have conditions.

24:33.740 --> 24:35.400
Finally getting to the point.

24:35.720 --> 24:36.720
What conditions?

24:37.300 --> 24:38.480
From this day on,

24:38.840 --> 24:41.080
serve me, body and soul.

24:41.590 --> 24:42.450
Keep dreaming.

24:42.870 --> 24:44.960
Serve me, and you live.

24:45.240 --> 24:47.240
Refuse, and you die.

24:48.000 --> 24:48.750
Looks to me

24:48.750 --> 24:50.610
like you don't have many choices.

24:51.310 --> 24:52.150
Fu Yixiao,

24:52.510 --> 24:53.310
though there are

24:53.310 --> 24:54.640
no weapons in this room,

24:55.030 --> 24:56.960
there are plenty of sharp objects.

24:57.070 --> 24:58.590
If you truly wanted to die,

24:58.640 --> 25:00.110
you've had ample opportunity.

25:00.110 --> 25:01.550
But instead of seeking death,

25:01.550 --> 25:02.960
you stayed here waiting for me.

25:02.960 --> 25:05.090
That means you've thought it through.

25:05.470 --> 25:07.030
You know your only chance

25:07.050 --> 25:08.390
to uncover the truth

25:08.550 --> 25:10.640
is to join forces with me.

25:16.510 --> 25:17.910
If you want cooperation,

25:18.110 --> 25:20.110
at least prepare good wine and food.

25:37.160 --> 25:38.070
Why are you so interested

25:38.070 --> 25:39.200
in who wants me dead?

25:41.870 --> 25:42.850
Doesn't seem

25:42.920 --> 25:44.240
to concern you.

25:45.000 --> 25:46.440
If you won't speak honestly,

25:46.440 --> 25:47.880
you're clearly not sincere.

25:47.880 --> 25:49.180
My enemy colluded with Jinxiu

25:49.180 --> 25:50.380
to set me up.

25:50.480 --> 25:51.550
And the traitor

25:51.550 --> 25:53.200
is likely the same person in Jinxiu

25:53.200 --> 25:54.260
who wants you dead.

25:54.510 --> 25:55.420
I need your help

25:55.550 --> 25:57.160
to find a clue to his betrayal,

25:57.160 --> 25:58.220
uncover evidence,

25:58.640 --> 25:59.440
take him down,

26:00.000 --> 26:00.790
and kill him.

26:04.310 --> 26:05.750
You saw it with your own eyes

26:05.750 --> 26:07.150
when we entered the city.

26:07.550 --> 26:09.590
There are people
in Susha who want me dead.

26:09.590 --> 26:11.810
People who want to eliminate me.

26:12.400 --> 26:13.000
And you,

26:13.680 --> 26:15.770
a decorated warrior on the battlefield,

26:15.770 --> 26:17.380
betrayed by your own.

26:18.000 --> 26:19.400
Aren't we the same?

26:20.720 --> 26:21.830
You and I were meant

26:22.270 --> 26:24.270
to share in each other's sorrow.

26:25.550 --> 26:26.160
I see now.

26:27.000 --> 26:28.200
You just want to use me

26:28.240 --> 26:29.100
to kill for you.

26:29.920 --> 26:31.120
Why should I help you?

26:31.880 --> 26:32.940
Don't call it help.

26:33.240 --> 26:34.770
And don't say I'm using you.

26:35.200 --> 26:36.960
Call it mutual benefit.

26:38.440 --> 26:39.040
Is that so?

26:39.590 --> 26:40.390
Let's hear it.

26:42.430 --> 26:43.890
Your left hand is useless.

26:44.000 --> 26:44.590
Even if

26:44.590 --> 26:46.590
you found the one who wants you dead,

26:46.720 --> 26:48.240
you couldn't take them down alone.

26:48.240 --> 26:49.640
And you've lost your memory,

26:49.640 --> 26:50.920
with no leads and no clues.

26:50.920 --> 26:51.920
Even if your killer

26:51.920 --> 26:54.160
were standing right in front of you,

26:54.310 --> 26:55.910
you wouldn't be able to tell.

26:56.680 --> 26:57.350
But I

26:57.590 --> 26:58.510
have men.

26:58.830 --> 26:59.640
I have means.

26:59.960 --> 27:01.160
You could use me.

27:04.680 --> 27:06.290
Just say what you want.

27:06.750 --> 27:09.070
No need to pretend
you're doing this for me.

27:09.070 --> 27:10.200
I've already done the thinking for you.

27:10.200 --> 27:11.590
Saves you the trouble.

27:12.550 --> 27:13.430
Don't forget

27:13.750 --> 27:14.720
we're enemies.

27:15.110 --> 27:16.590
Aren't you seeking revenge?

27:16.590 --> 27:18.050
If you agree to cooperate,

27:18.200 --> 27:20.030
our past grievances are erased.

27:20.350 --> 27:21.950
Never to be mentioned again.

27:29.830 --> 27:30.750
Sounds like

27:31.200 --> 27:32.000
I have no reason

27:32.000 --> 27:32.920
to refuse.

27:34.290 --> 27:35.570
Then here's to

27:37.310 --> 27:38.840
a successful partnership.

27:40.640 --> 27:42.170
A successful partnership.

27:52.550 --> 27:54.080
You may have let the past go,

27:54.360 --> 27:55.210
but I haven't.

27:55.890 --> 27:57.090
Cooperate if we must,

27:57.440 --> 27:58.510
but our score

27:59.050 --> 28:00.310
will still be settled.

28:01.640 --> 28:03.500
-Your Highness!
-Your Highness!

28:06.600 --> 28:07.210
Move!

28:07.680 --> 28:08.310
Let us out!

28:08.400 --> 28:09.130
Fu Yixiao.

28:09.160 --> 28:10.460
Let go of His Highness!

28:12.680 --> 28:13.880
Ask them to step back.

28:14.680 --> 28:15.380
Step back.

28:15.550 --> 28:16.410
Your Highness!

28:16.480 --> 28:17.080
Step back!

28:32.840 --> 28:38.950
[Wutong Mansion]

28:40.010 --> 28:40.820
Fu Yixiao!

28:41.790 --> 28:43.110
If you so much as lay a finger

28:43.110 --> 28:44.070
on His Highness,

28:45.200 --> 28:47.200
I swear I'll...

28:50.510 --> 28:51.370
I said back off.

28:52.400 --> 28:53.310
No one follows!

28:53.380 --> 28:54.240
Your Highness.

28:56.680 --> 28:58.480
You're quite composed.

28:59.510 --> 29:00.960
You drag me off

29:00.980 --> 29:02.070
in broad daylight.

29:02.270 --> 29:04.470
Aren't you afraid it'll get you killed?

29:04.570 --> 29:06.440
This is Susha.

29:06.640 --> 29:07.900
We'll see

29:08.000 --> 29:09.230
who dies first.

29:10.350 --> 29:11.210
Take the reins.

29:15.490 --> 29:17.630
[Wutong Mansion]

29:15.750 --> 29:16.610
Your Highness.

29:20.070 --> 29:20.670
After her!

29:21.720 --> 29:23.330
[Wutong Mansion]

29:22.630 --> 29:23.690
What are you doing?

29:23.790 --> 29:25.190
His Highness forbade it.

29:25.720 --> 29:26.240
I...

29:28.000 --> 29:29.220
Right. What's going on?

29:29.220 --> 29:30.440
I don't know.

29:57.680 --> 29:58.640
Miss Yixiao,

29:58.640 --> 30:00.360
your true intentions lie elsewhere.

30:00.360 --> 30:00.880
Shut up.

30:03.100 --> 30:04.360
Did you find anything?

30:05.830 --> 30:06.590
She's alive.

30:06.750 --> 30:07.420
Really?

30:07.790 --> 30:08.990
Then where is she now?

30:09.720 --> 30:11.970
Seems she's been taken to Yujing.

30:12.040 --> 30:18.280
[Skill and Sincerity in Great Medicine]

30:12.590 --> 30:13.200
Told you,

30:13.240 --> 30:14.750
in matters between Jinxiu and Susha,

30:14.750 --> 30:15.480
there's nothing

30:15.480 --> 30:16.740
Mr. Qin can't find out.

30:17.510 --> 30:18.030
Mr. Qin.

30:18.030 --> 30:19.490
Whose children are these?

30:19.720 --> 30:20.750
What's wrong with them?

30:20.750 --> 30:21.270
This...

30:21.550 --> 30:22.550
Is no one looking after them?

30:22.550 --> 30:23.160
Poor kids.

30:23.180 --> 30:24.500
Make way! Make way!

30:24.690 --> 30:25.620
What's going on?

30:30.550 --> 30:31.610
What's the matter?

30:34.960 --> 30:35.620
Eleven.

30:35.920 --> 30:36.750
Have the kitchen prepare

30:36.750 --> 30:38.410
some light porridge for them.

30:38.550 --> 30:38.960
Okay.

30:42.200 --> 30:42.810
Kids,

30:42.920 --> 30:43.830
where are you from?

30:43.830 --> 30:44.830
Where are your parents?

30:44.830 --> 30:46.590
We're looking for...

30:48.880 --> 30:50.410
We're looking for someone.

30:51.030 --> 30:52.690
Don't know if she's been here.

30:53.270 --> 30:54.370
Who are you looking for?

30:54.370 --> 30:55.840
She's a woman,

30:56.200 --> 30:57.270
dressed in red,

30:58.240 --> 30:59.640
skilled in martial arts.

31:03.350 --> 31:05.270
So she's your master.

31:06.660 --> 31:08.390
That means you're from Jinxiu.

31:08.460 --> 31:10.020
We don't know each other.

31:10.130 --> 31:11.480
Don't pry any further.

31:11.650 --> 31:12.720
Master told us

31:12.790 --> 31:15.050
to stay sharp when we're out in the world.

31:15.110 --> 31:16.550
Let me just ask you one thing.

31:16.550 --> 31:17.460
Answer if you want to,

31:17.460 --> 31:18.720
if not, then forget it.

31:18.790 --> 31:19.960
Where is my master?

31:21.270 --> 31:22.310
This little girl

31:22.310 --> 31:24.240
really does resemble Yixiao a bit.

31:27.000 --> 31:28.330
She was taken to Yujing.

31:36.540 --> 31:37.540
Stop right there!

31:38.030 --> 31:39.830
Where do you think you're going?

31:40.370 --> 31:42.100
Thank you for the steamed buns.

31:46.070 --> 31:46.550
Stop!

31:47.510 --> 31:47.960
Kids!

31:51.790 --> 31:52.310
Kids!

31:56.640 --> 31:57.400
Eleven!

31:59.830 --> 32:00.200
Here.

32:04.110 --> 32:04.590
Here.

32:06.400 --> 32:07.940
One isn't enough.

32:08.030 --> 32:08.830
Take a few more.

32:08.830 --> 32:09.750
They're all for you.

32:09.750 --> 32:10.070
Right.

32:10.070 --> 32:10.970
One is enough.

32:11.030 --> 32:12.430
Any more would be greedy.

32:12.790 --> 32:14.030
Once we find our master,

32:14.030 --> 32:15.960
we'll surely repay your kindness.

32:17.070 --> 32:18.160
A few steamed buns,

32:18.200 --> 32:19.830
not exactly a great kindness.

32:19.830 --> 32:21.030
Do you know how far Yujing

32:21.030 --> 32:21.900
is from here?

32:22.000 --> 32:22.800
Very far.

32:22.880 --> 32:24.410
One bun won't get you there.

32:35.030 --> 32:36.270
Then let me escort you.

32:36.270 --> 32:36.930
Wait for me.

32:37.240 --> 32:37.720
I'll pack more buns

32:37.720 --> 32:39.050
for the kids.

32:40.160 --> 32:42.090
I haven't said you could leave yet.

33:09.680 --> 33:12.060
Your Highness, you're delicate and fair.

33:12.270 --> 33:13.930
You would make

33:13.950 --> 33:15.170
a fine boy toy.

33:18.350 --> 33:19.960
During the Battle of Pingling,

33:19.960 --> 33:21.020
that arrow

33:21.200 --> 33:24.070
should've pierced right through here.

33:34.310 --> 33:36.230
If you kill me,

33:36.420 --> 33:37.880
you won't survive either.

33:38.480 --> 33:39.240
Kill you?

33:40.030 --> 33:40.700
You've finally

33:40.700 --> 33:41.900
fallen into my hands.

33:42.350 --> 33:42.880
Of course

33:42.880 --> 33:44.350
I must treat you properly.

34:03.070 --> 34:04.070
You two, come with me.

34:04.070 --> 34:04.850
The rest, go that way.

34:04.850 --> 34:05.550
Yes.

34:31.280 --> 34:32.150
Fifteen.

34:32.710 --> 34:33.400
Sixteen.

34:36.030 --> 34:36.690
How's that?

34:37.480 --> 34:38.440
How do you feel?

34:40.800 --> 34:41.280
Right.

34:41.710 --> 34:43.110
How many did I just count?

34:43.920 --> 34:44.630
Eleven.

34:45.090 --> 34:45.790
Wasn't it?

34:46.110 --> 34:48.050
Yes, 11.

34:48.630 --> 34:51.400
47 minus 11…

34:54.150 --> 34:55.810
Still quite a few lashes left.

35:40.590 --> 35:41.690
Exactly 47 lashes,

35:42.070 --> 35:43.360
no more, no less.

35:44.210 --> 35:45.790
You shot me with an arrow,

35:46.480 --> 35:48.190
then saved me by feeding me medicine

35:48.190 --> 35:49.320
in the medical pool.

35:49.840 --> 35:51.900
I gave you 47 lashes.

35:52.510 --> 35:53.670
And you lashed me

35:53.710 --> 35:54.840
back.

35:56.550 --> 35:57.920
Now we're even.

36:00.130 --> 36:01.660
And you think it ends there?

36:02.070 --> 36:03.160
I repay

36:03.400 --> 36:04.670
all debts.

36:05.070 --> 36:06.280
Grudges and kindnesses alike,

36:06.280 --> 36:07.550
in double.

36:08.580 --> 36:10.280
Fu Yixiao.

36:10.800 --> 36:11.760
I've tolerated you

36:11.760 --> 36:13.750
because I want to cooperate.

36:13.840 --> 36:16.590
Don't push your luck.

36:17.630 --> 36:18.470
Enough.

36:18.800 --> 36:19.930
Untie me!

36:20.070 --> 36:22.190
You think I'll let you
go just because you said so?

36:22.190 --> 36:23.360
When you tied me up,

36:23.400 --> 36:24.800
I thought the same thing.

36:25.190 --> 36:26.320
Did you let me go?

36:27.150 --> 36:29.030
You dragged me all this way,

36:29.360 --> 36:30.960
not just to vent,

36:33.590 --> 36:36.550
but to lure someone out, didn't you?

36:49.400 --> 36:50.220
Tell me,

36:50.920 --> 36:52.380
who am I trying to lure out?

36:53.030 --> 36:55.250
I've fought too many battles.

36:56.090 --> 36:57.780
If I couldn't tell someone

36:57.810 --> 36:58.840
was tailing me,

36:58.920 --> 37:00.720
how would I have lived this long?

37:01.080 --> 37:02.230
You're right.

37:02.260 --> 37:03.650
Someone has been

37:03.670 --> 37:04.960
following us

37:05.400 --> 37:06.930
from Zhengnian Villa

37:07.000 --> 37:08.790
all the way to Susha.

37:22.000 --> 37:22.530
Let's go.

37:25.400 --> 37:25.930
Let's go.

37:26.760 --> 37:27.290
Let's go.

37:29.590 --> 37:31.530
You want to use me

37:31.800 --> 37:33.180
to capture them.

37:33.670 --> 37:34.880
While my people

37:34.920 --> 37:36.760
clash with them,

37:36.760 --> 37:38.000
you reap the rewards.

37:38.070 --> 37:39.400
Two gains with one move.

37:42.030 --> 37:43.560
But have you considered it?

37:45.080 --> 37:46.970
This is Susha.

37:47.480 --> 37:49.660
My spies are everywhere.

37:49.680 --> 37:50.320
Even if

37:50.320 --> 37:52.300
they dared follow,

37:52.360 --> 37:53.960
they wouldn't get close.

37:54.710 --> 37:57.090
Your plan may fall apart.

37:57.880 --> 37:58.840
But no worries.

37:59.670 --> 38:00.710
I can

38:00.760 --> 38:02.320
help you catch them.

38:02.560 --> 38:03.390
No need.

38:03.960 --> 38:05.810
You just agreed to cooperate.

38:06.280 --> 38:08.360
Now you want to back out?

38:10.710 --> 38:11.800
Your face,

38:12.220 --> 38:13.580
half smiling,

38:14.360 --> 38:15.740
half scheming.

38:15.990 --> 38:17.540
Just like you,

38:17.760 --> 38:19.070
part righteous, part wicked.

38:19.070 --> 38:20.230
Impossible to read.

38:21.510 --> 38:22.440
Is there anyone

38:23.070 --> 38:25.330
in this world who truly understands you?

38:29.440 --> 38:31.550
You think you can see through me?

38:32.150 --> 38:33.150
Seems those around you

38:33.150 --> 38:34.550
don't know you at all.

38:35.030 --> 38:35.930
Then again,

38:36.280 --> 38:37.360
someone like you

38:37.630 --> 38:39.360
probably doesn't have many friends.

38:39.360 --> 38:41.920
If you want to understand me that badly,

38:42.510 --> 38:43.150
fine.

38:43.510 --> 38:44.360
Go ahead.

38:44.880 --> 38:46.240
Take a good look.

38:47.710 --> 38:49.200
As long as my arrow

38:49.360 --> 38:50.780
can pierce through here,

38:53.670 --> 38:55.400
I don't need to understand you.

38:55.710 --> 38:56.400
Agreed.

38:57.070 --> 38:57.880
All we need

38:57.920 --> 38:59.440
is cooperation.

39:00.070 --> 39:02.480
Understanding or not, does it matter?

39:02.710 --> 39:04.030
Let's place a bet.

39:04.480 --> 39:05.280
Let's bet

39:05.670 --> 39:07.030
that I can become a partner

39:07.030 --> 39:09.280
you can truly rely on.

39:10.360 --> 39:11.190
Do you dare?

39:12.110 --> 39:13.030
Why wouldn't I?

39:14.880 --> 39:16.640
Why didn't you act earlier?

39:22.840 --> 39:23.840
His Lordship said

39:24.030 --> 39:24.920
it's best if Fu Yixiao

39:24.920 --> 39:26.150
dies by Feng Suige's hand.

39:26.150 --> 39:27.840
If Feng Suige really wanted to kill her,

39:27.840 --> 39:29.250
he would've done it at the post station.

39:29.250 --> 39:30.670
Why bring her all the way to Yujing?

39:30.670 --> 39:31.830
This is Susha.

39:32.320 --> 39:32.920
To strike

39:32.960 --> 39:34.020
under Feng Suige's watch,

39:34.020 --> 39:35.450
[Time is running out.
You must get rid of Fu Yixiao.]

39:34.070 --> 39:35.400
we only have one chance.

39:35.470 --> 39:37.630
[Fu Yixiao is skilful.
You must plan carefully.]

39:35.510 --> 39:36.550
To hit the mark,

39:36.800 --> 39:38.130
we must wait patiently.

39:40.320 --> 39:41.510
His Lordship also said

39:41.510 --> 39:42.960
reinforcements are on their way.

39:42.960 --> 39:44.520
We must not act rashly.

39:45.070 --> 39:46.360
If we alert the enemy,

39:46.400 --> 39:47.800
we'll lose our only shot.

39:51.190 --> 39:51.590
You...

39:56.480 --> 39:57.410
I'll cooperate.

39:57.670 --> 39:59.320
But I have my conditions.

40:00.070 --> 40:00.800
Speak.

40:01.150 --> 40:01.800
First,

40:01.920 --> 40:02.800
I will never do anything

40:02.800 --> 40:04.000
to harm Jinxiu.

40:04.150 --> 40:05.320
If you want me to betray them,

40:05.320 --> 40:06.510
you'll have to kill me.

40:06.510 --> 40:07.000
Agreed.

40:07.590 --> 40:08.110
Second,

40:08.630 --> 40:10.290
if we uncover the person behind it all,

40:10.290 --> 40:12.000
I'll interrogate them myself.

40:12.000 --> 40:13.710
You must not hide anything from me.

40:13.710 --> 40:14.310
Of course.

40:14.590 --> 40:15.360
Third,

40:15.510 --> 40:17.110
I can go whenever I want.

40:17.550 --> 40:18.680
You must not stop me.

40:23.280 --> 40:24.410
In addition to that,

40:25.150 --> 40:26.000
I'll find someone

40:26.000 --> 40:27.530
to treat your injured hand,

40:27.670 --> 40:29.480
so you can defend yourself.

40:32.740 --> 40:33.670
It's a deal.

40:34.000 --> 40:35.110
A deal.

40:36.670 --> 40:37.770
We're even

40:38.440 --> 40:39.030
now.

40:53.190 --> 40:54.250
What are you doing?

40:54.400 --> 40:55.440
Why so anxious?

40:56.150 --> 40:58.280
There's still one more debt to settle.

41:00.720 --> 41:03.570
♪ Take down the setting sun as my heart ♪

41:04.090 --> 41:07.130
♪ Fold the heavens and earth
to make my wings ♪

41:08.150 --> 41:09.400
♪ If fate shows no mercy ♪

41:09.930 --> 41:13.110
♪ Then don't blame my recklessness ♪

41:15.430 --> 41:18.320
♪ I thought this life
would drift like a solitary sail ♪

41:19.040 --> 41:21.790
♪ Yet I chanced upon you
in the smoke-filled alleyway ♪

41:26.920 --> 41:28.320
What kind of play is this?

41:32.300 --> 41:32.870
Come.

41:33.500 --> 41:35.030
-Turn around.
-Don't look.

41:40.150 --> 41:41.540
Don't look. Don't look.

41:50.710 --> 41:53.000
Now we're truly even.

41:57.070 --> 41:59.950
[Wutong Mansion]

42:09.920 --> 42:11.050
Why are you smiling?

42:11.750 --> 42:12.530
I'm not.

42:13.590 --> 42:14.720
You clearly smiled.

42:14.960 --> 42:15.590
Did I?

42:17.070 --> 42:18.280
But I saw you smile.

42:18.920 --> 42:19.920
There's nothing to be happy about.

42:19.920 --> 42:20.920
Why would I smile?

42:25.190 --> 42:26.720
See? You're smiling again.

42:27.880 --> 42:28.440
Come in.

42:34.530 --> 42:36.000
[To the Marshal: Our forces retreated
from Pingling City to the eastern woods,]

42:35.070 --> 42:36.510
You all think that we lost

42:36.000 --> 42:37.270
[where we were ambushed by the Zhennan
Army, numbering over 1,000.]

42:36.550 --> 42:37.810
the Battle of Pingling

42:38.020 --> 42:39.030
because Fu Yixiao

42:39.070 --> 42:40.400
shot me with an arrow.

42:41.800 --> 42:43.400
But have you ever considered

42:43.440 --> 42:45.280
why Jinxiu was able to immediately

42:45.280 --> 42:46.800
mobilize their troops

42:46.800 --> 42:48.860
and launch a massive counterattack?

42:49.190 --> 42:50.920
And they attacked from both flanks,

42:50.920 --> 42:52.150
surrounding us on three sides.

42:52.150 --> 42:53.190
They even knew

42:53.230 --> 42:54.030
our retreat route

42:54.030 --> 42:55.230
perfectly.

42:56.890 --> 42:58.750
At these three strategic passes,

42:59.190 --> 43:00.280
Jinxiu had already planted ambushes

43:00.280 --> 43:01.940
before the battle even began.

43:02.940 --> 43:04.600
Your Highness, are you saying

43:05.150 --> 43:06.510
Jinxiu knew from the start

43:06.510 --> 43:07.570
that we would lose?

43:07.800 --> 43:08.930
That's impossible.

43:09.030 --> 43:10.440
If you hadn't taken that arrow,

43:10.440 --> 43:11.550
we would've captured

43:11.550 --> 43:11.920
Zhennan Pass...

43:11.920 --> 43:12.360
No.

43:12.840 --> 43:13.960
If we had taken Zhennan Pass,

43:13.960 --> 43:15.760
our next move
would've been to march into the city.

43:15.760 --> 43:16.510
The fact that Jinxiu was able to

43:16.510 --> 43:17.150
mobilize all forces

43:17.150 --> 43:18.150
instantly

43:18.510 --> 43:19.280
proves that the city

43:19.280 --> 43:20.280
was already heavily fortified.

43:20.280 --> 43:21.280
If we had entered,

43:21.440 --> 43:23.110
they only needed to close the gates,

43:23.110 --> 43:23.840
and our entire army

43:23.840 --> 43:25.630
would've been
slaughtered with no burial ground.
